   "text": "a FEATURE FLAG grows a rollout range: 10% -> 20%\n  users already inside the range keep their bucket;\n  only the new edge adds users        <- the whole point",
   "originalText": "a FEATURE FLAG grows a rollout range: 10% -> 20%\n  users already inside the range keep their bucket;\n  only the new edge adds users        <- the whole point",
