   "locked": false,
   "text": "an exposure  a durable UNIQUE(experiment_id, user_id)\n             has to stay deduplicated for the ENTIRE RUN -\n             days to weeks - and is worth keeping permanently",
   "originalText": "an exposure  a durable UNIQUE(experiment_id, user_id)\n             has to stay deduplicated for the ENTIRE RUN -\n             days to weeks - and is worth keeping permanently",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "uniq",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "cn",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 1254,
   "width": 1019,
   "height": 65,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100121,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700847,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "An exposure is a fact worth keeping for audit and later re-analysis, not something safe to let expire. A durable unique\nconstraint gives the identical 'first exposure wins, everything after is a no-op' guarantee as a payments idempotency key, at\nthe timescale this table's data actually needs. It is also, simultaneously, the index every join in the aggregator uses to ask\n'has this user already been exposed to this experiment?'",
   "originalText": "An exposure is a fact worth keeping for audit and later re-analysis, not something safe to let expire. A durable unique\nconstraint gives the identical 'first exposure wins, everything after is a no-op' guarantee as a payments idempotency key, at\nthe timescale this table's data actually needs. It is also, simultaneously, the index every join in the aggregator uses to ask\n'has this user already been exposed to this experiment?'",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
