   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "the unique-constraint check has to be atomic, for the same reason a payment's idempotency key does. But an internal audit\npulling one experiment's full exposure list is a legitimate replica read: replication lag does not change who was actually\nexposed, only how promptly an ad hoc query reflects the very latest exposure.",
   "originalText": "the unique-constraint check has to be atomic, for the same reason a payment's idempotency key does. But an internal audit\npulling one experiment's full exposure list is a legitimate replica read: replication lag does not change who was actually\nexposed, only how promptly an ad hoc query reflects the very latest exposure.",
   "fontSize": 12,
